  "command": "./dev test --suite business-domains-upgrade",
  "scope": "Exact SQL010-to011 upgrade plus real direct storage/concurrency qualification",
  "checks": [
    "Exact SQL001\u2013010 migrator creates representative legacy model/type assets, mixed relation histories and a complete positive-participation graph receipt through actual runtime code",
    "All eight newly reserved namespaces reject foreign-tenant prior success rows through forced RLS and preserve each exact row with complete upgrade rollback",
    "Malformed applied predecessor checksum aborts before SQL011 and preserves actual complete SQL010 state",
    "SQL011 preserves exact legacy canonical/history/receipt/journal data and creates no fabricated placement rows or revisions",
    "Exact SQL001\u2013011 checksum replay is idempotent with all ten applied predecessor bytes unchanged",
    "All nineteen domain tables force tenant RLS; runtime owns no tables, cannot bypass RLS, and has no schema CREATE or TEMP capability",
    "All 18 real runtime-role storage cases pass without skips, cancellations or retries",
    "All 9 independent PostgreSQL-session concurrency/original-deadline cases pass without skips, cancellations or retries"
  ],
